<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description> useful macro for a stelba with an AK-47

!!!This macro works only with AK-47!!!! 
=======================================================================================
1) Download the macro
2) Bind to a convenient key for you, (I do not advise you to press the insole button, it is best to press the side buttons)
3) Go to the crossfire and test
4) Do not hold the button for a very long time, the macro will burn with sharp movements.
=======================================================================================
Everything is very easy!!!


Ps I do not advise you to use the macro on the rating, it can kick for a third-party software
Ps не советую юзать макрос на рейтинге, может кикнуть за сторонее ПО
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
